From: Shimazu <vanessimbolon2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:19:04 +0000
Subject: SmeltMaterial: Replace deprecated Material.getMaterial(String) with matchMaterial

AE PATCH REASON: Material.getMaterial(String) is deprecated and inconsistent with modern Paper material resolution; matchMaterial is the supported lookup.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace five Material.getMaterial("...") calls (DEEPSLATE, SMOOTH_SANDSTONE, SMOOTH_BASALT, SPONGE, SMOOTH_RED_SANDSTONE) with Material.matchMaterial("...").
AE PATCH RISK: LOW - API: Material.getMaterial → matchMaterial. No behavior change.

---
diff --git a/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/abilities/SmeltMaterial.java b/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/abilities/SmeltMaterial.java
--- a/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/abilities/SmeltMaterial.java	2026-07-30 10:27:31.678350213 +0000
+++ b/net/advancedplugins/ae/impl/utils/abilities/SmeltMaterial.java	2026-07-31 00:30:59.919292758 +0000
@@ -19,7 +19,7 @@
 
          switch (var1) {
             case "COBBLED_DEEPSLATE":
-               return new ItemStack(Material.getMaterial("DEEPSLATE"));
+               return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("DEEPSLATE"));
             case "COBBLESTONE":
                return new ItemStack(Material.STONE);
             case "DEEPSLATE_COAL_ORE":
@@ -58,9 +58,9 @@
             case "SAND":
                return new ItemStack(Material.GLASS);
             case "SANDSTONE":
-               return new ItemStack(Material.getMaterial("SMOOTH_SANDSTONE"));
+               return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("SMOOTH_SANDSTONE"));
             case "BASALT":
-               return new ItemStack(Material.getMaterial("SMOOTH_BASALT"));
+               return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("SMOOTH_BASALT"));
             case "NETHERRACK":
                return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("NETHER_BRICK"));
             case "CLAY":
@@ -68,9 +68,9 @@
             case "CLAY_BALL":
                return new ItemBuilder(Material.matchMaterial("BRICK")).setAmount(var0.getAmount()).toItemStack();
             case "WET_SPONGE":
-               return new ItemStack(Material.getMaterial("SPONGE"));
+               return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("SPONGE"));
             case "RED_SANDSTONE":
-               return new ItemStack(Material.getMaterial("SMOOTH_RED_SANDSTONE"));
+               return new ItemStack(Material.matchMaterial("SMOOTH_RED_SANDSTONE"));
             default:
                return new ItemStack(var0);
          }
